// ==========================================================
// Detection: Service Principal Creation
// Description: Detects creation of a new Microsoft Entra service
//              principal that could be used to establish persistence.
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1136 - Create Account
// Tactic: Persistence
// Severity: Medium
// Data Source: AuditLogs
// False Positives: Legitimate application registrations,
//                  CI/CD integrations, approved SaaS applications
// Response Playbook: create-incident
// Author: Aruna Oluwaseun
// Last Updated: August 2026
// ==========================================================

AuditLogs
| where OperationName has "Add service principal"
| project TimeGenerated, InitiatedBy, Result